        <item>
            <title>5.57</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 12:20:13 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>349</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.57</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.57</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Remove objects.</b> The inpaint brush has a new Remove mode: paint over an object and it disappears, including shadows and reflections. No prompt needed.</li>
<li><b>Generative expand.</b> Drag the canvas edges outward, Photoshop style, and the new borders get generated. An optional prompt steers what appears.</li>
<li><b>Pixel-exact edits.</b> In both new modes, everything outside the marked area stays byte-identical to the original.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
